OL,3,GNEWSAMan found shot dead inside car in
OL,4,Aeast London
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 40s has been found shot
OL,7,Fdead inside a car in east London, the
OL,8,FMetropolitan Police said.
OL,10,FA murder investigation has begun after
OL,11,Fofficers were called to St
OL,12,FBartholomew's Road, Newham, at about
OL,13,F03:00 BST and found a man with gunshot
OL,14,Fwounds, the force said.
OL,16,FHe was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,17,FThe man's family have been informed and
OL,18,Fare being supported by specialist
OL,19,Fofficers.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
